      "reasons": [
        "The packet supports that Langerhans cells increase in dry eye disease and that they negatively regulate ocular-surface inflammation and have a neuroprotective function, but it does not clearly support the broader definitional claim that they are simply “cells found on the ocular surface.”",
        "The wording also goes beyond the packet by presenting the role as established clinical fact rather than as the study’s supported conclusion in dry eye disease."
